      "message": "The auto-disting in sdk_library.go is kind of a legacy behavior as it wasn\u0027t possible to specify dist in soong at the time.\n\nWhat I was thinking was that we could manually specify conscrypt like..\n\n  dists {\n    dist: {\n      tag: \"public.stub\"\n      path: \"apistubs/../conscrypt.jar\"\n      name: \"conscrypt.jar\"\n    }\n    dist: {\n      tag: \"public.api\"\n      path:  \"apistubs/../conscrypt.txt\"\n    }\n   ...\n  }\n\n\nquite a lot of boilerplate though.\n\nThe correct thing to do longer term is probably to define sdk{} for all of these and dist all of those, and make the update-prebuilts script unzip the disted sdks.",
